      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's exactly what i was looking for. it really pushes the point home. i think some people might argue that aid is just inefficient or that it doesn't actually solve the root causes, but how can we respond to that? i want to show them that those arguments are basically just excuses to avoid doing what is morally right.",
